<title>HONG KONG: INTERVIEW - Regent say Hambros &quot;better broken up&quot;.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW - Regent say Hambros &quot;better broken up&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regent Pacific Fund Management said it will seek the support of major shareholders in Hambros Bank if the company fails to respond to its requests to realize shareholder value.</p>
<p>&quot;The thing is better broken up,&quot; Regent managing director James Mellon told Reuters in an interview on Thursday.</p>
</text>
